"description": "Bill Holdings, Inc. engages in the provision of cloud-based financial operations software solutions. The firm provides software that helps small and midsize businesses automate accounts payable, accounts receivable, spend and expense management, payments, and other financial operations. Its software enables customers to manage invoices, approvals, payments, expenses, and cash flow, and integrate financial operations with accounting systems. The company was founded by Rene Lacerte in April 2006 and is headquartered in San Jose, CA.",
